You can install desktop environment on Forsaken Linux

to install

For gnome sudo apt install gnome gdm3
For kde sudo apt install task-kde-desktop
For XFCE Run sudo apt install xfce4 xfce4-goodies
For Cinnamon Run sudo apt install task-cinnamon-desktop

after install run sudo rm -rf /usr/share/desktop-base

You can also install other desktop environment

For GNOME you must check ls /usr/share/desktop-base
if there is /usr/share/desktop-base run sudo rm -rf /usr/share/desktop-base then sudo apt-mark hold desktop-base

Note if the wallpaper is just plain color for example gnome having a blue in debian without desktop base you can change with default wallpaper

For KDE Plasma XFCE And Cinnamon and Other Desktop Environment you must check ls /usr/share/desktop-base 
if there is /usr/share/desktop-base run sudo apt remove desktop-base && sudo apt purge desktop-base -y && sudo apt autoremove -y && sudo apt-mark hold desktop-base
